# Check out text as LF on every OS. Windows runners and Git for Windows default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which would turn the generated API types (src/api/generated, the Kotlin
# ones in mobile/) and the agent prompts embedded with include_str! into CRLF, so the
# "generated types are up to date" tests and the prompts differ from what the repository holds.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Stored with CRLF in the repository (mobile/gradlew.bat), kept byte for byte.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
